"Too many files already use this name. Rename an existing file and try again." = "使用此名称的文件过多，请重命名已有文件后重试。";
"The file could not be completed: %@" = "无法完成文件创建：%@";
"A file may remain at %@. Check this location before trying again." = "文件可能仍保留在 %@，请检查此位置后再重试。";
"This menu has expired. Please reopen it." = "此菜单已失效，请重新打开右键菜单。";

